 flat-mode entry of the compression is the Rayleigh quotient $4-2-0 = 2$, $A_z$ is an unevaluated parameter, and the
 gap between the two distinct entries is the identity $4\sin^2(\pi k/q)$. Verdict on the bridge: missing
 identification, neither derived nor ruled out,
 \doi{10.5281/zenodo.19802123}}
}

